  You may convey verbatim copies of the Program's source code for
Noncommercial Purposes, without a fee, in any medium, provided that you
conspicuously retain applicable copyright notices, notices identifying
this License and any permitted terms under section 7, and warranty
disclaimers, and provide every recipient with the full text of this
