Access must not require payment, individual approval, or a nondisclosure
agreement. Keep the source accessible throughout the period in which you
convey that version, and do not prevent recipients from retaining copies.
A promise to supply source later does not satisfy this requirement.

  A recipient must be able to use, copy, modify, and convey the source
under the same conditions, including the noncommercial restriction. The
requirement to provide source does not authorize Commercial Use.

